//   2. henvcfg.CBZE=1, senvcfg.CBZE=0: VU-mode raises virtual-instruction, VS-mode still zeroes.
//   3. menvcfg.CBZE=0: VS and VU raise illegal-instruction for both henvcfg.CBZE values; HS-mode
//     raises illegal-instruction.
